<!-- デスクトップアプリ（WinUI 3。Windows でしかビルドできない）と、それが使うプロジェクト。TTDeployTool.sln とは分ける（詳細設計 3.2） -->
<Solution>
  <Configurations>
    <Platform Name="x64" />
    <Platform Name="ARM64" />
  </Configurations>
  <Folder Name="/src/">
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Common/TTDeployTool.Common.csproj" />
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Domain/TTDeployTool.Domain.csproj" />
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Infrastructure.Azure/TTDeployTool.Infrastructure.Azure.csproj" />
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Application/TTDeployTool.Application.csproj" />
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.Core/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.Core.csproj" />
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.Fixtures/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.Fixtures.csproj" />
    <!-- C# のプロジェクトは既定でソリューションのどのプラットフォームでも Any CPU を使うため、このプロジェクト（x64 / ARM64 だけ）は明示する -->
    <Project Path="src/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.csproj">
      <Platform Solution="*|x64" Project="x64" />
      <Platform Solution="*|ARM64" Project="ARM64" />
      <Deploy />
    </Project>
  </Folder>
  <Folder Name="/tests/">
    <Project Path="tests/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.Core.Tests/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.Core.Tests.csproj" />
    <Project Path="tests/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.UITests/TTDeployTool.Controller.Desktop.UITests.csproj" />
  </Folder>
</Solution>
